			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 250290101,
					"content": "乖乖喔，不要灰心，只要你身体好了，然后…加油学习！一定能很快爬到山顶的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290102,
					"content": "呜呜…呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290103,
					"content": "你是不是肚子饿了？嗯…那我去给你拿点吃的喔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290104,
					"content": "呜…呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290105,
					"content": "你在做什么呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290106,
					"content": "我在陪我的伙伴奇卡玩呢。虽然它还很小，但我妈妈说，它长大后，肯定会和其他匿叶龙一样厉害！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290107,
					"content": "呜…呜呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290108,
					"content": "别难过啦。你只是身子太弱了，之前还受过伤。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290109,
					"content": "妈妈说，只要你多吃好吃的，然后和我一起多多锻炼，肯定会好起来的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290110,
					"content": "呜？呜呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290111,
						250290113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290111,
					"content": "（摸摸奇卡。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290112,
					"content": "呜呜…呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290119,
					"content": "哎呀，说了这么多话，马上就要锻炼了，先吃点东西好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290120,
					"content": "这可是我妈妈特制的果干，先在大锅里炒啊炒，然后加入很多香香的调料…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290121,
					"content": "而且还要加好多糖和花瓣…总之，味道可好了！我这就给你欸？…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290122,
					"content": "我的果干呢？明明放在包里的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290123,
					"content": "…呜，呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290124,
					"content": "呜哇！奇卡！难道都被你偷吃了？都说了不要馋嘴，吃多了就跑不动啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290125,
					"content": "唔唔，呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290126,
						250290127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290126,
					"content": "有食欲是好事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290128
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290128,
					"content": "呜呜，呜呜呜！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290129,
					"content": "是这样吗？那…我也要和奇卡一样。吃好多东西，快快长大，然后帮妈妈的忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290130,
					"content": "好，那我们就开始锻炼吧，奇卡！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290131,
					"content": "呜！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290132,
					"content": "我看看喔…那今天就训练一下登山吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290133,
					"content": "呜，呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290134,
					"content": "还是和上次一样，不会很难的。打起劲来呀，奇卡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290135,
					"content": "…呜！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290136,
					"content": "对了，亚瓦尔叔叔上次和我说，如果想要正经训练的话，就需要找到一个合理的「训练目标」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290137,
					"content": "要是我能找到一个很厉害的冒险家，让他帮我制订目标就好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290138,
						250290139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290138,
					"content": "我是比较厉害的冒险家。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290140
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290140,
					"content": "#真的？那…{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}，你愿意帮我吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290141,
						250290142
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290141,
					"content": "要我带着你们爬山吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290143
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290143,
					"content": "#不是不是，如果{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}真的那么厉害，我们可追不上啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290144
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290144,
					"content": "#我们会在地上看着{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}，算好时间的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290145
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290145,
					"content": "#拜托{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}用出全力，以最快的速度爬上山顶吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290146,
					"content": "呜！呜！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290142,
					"content": "好，跟着我，现在就开始！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290143
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290139,
					"content": "厉害的冒险家就在你身边。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290140
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290127,
					"content": "吃得多长得壮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290128
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290113,
					"content": "它是怎么受伤的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290114,
					"content": "我不知道…也许妈妈知道！但妈妈把奇卡带回来的时候，它就生着病呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290115,
					"content": "奇卡吃不下东西，也没力气动。我只能每天把药化在水里，然后喂它喝下去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290116,
					"content": "虽然奇卡最后病好了，但是…它的身体很弱。没办法像其他的匿叶龙一样，在悬崖旁边窜来窜去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290117,
					"content": "它因为这件事一直很难过，所以我想要帮它！让它恢复健康，然后…变得比其他匿叶龙还要强！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290118,
					"content": "呜！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				}
			]
		},
